 -5-  NC: 2024:KHC:10146-DB  CRL.A No. 555 of 2017  C/W CRL.A No. 2091 of 2017  JUDGMENT Aggrieved by the acquittal judgment dated 21.11.2016 in S.C. 156/2008 on the file of I Additional Sessions Judge, Kolar, the State has preferred Criminal Appeal 555/2017 and the defacto complainant-PW22 has preferred Criminal Appeal 2091/2017.
